      <memberdef kind="define" id="config_8h_1aa00b9ceb81dae19f5095fa251c99346e" prot="public" static="no">
        <name>VATOMIC_DISABLE_POLITE_AWAIT</name>
        <briefdescription>
<para>disables polite await in x86_64 and aarch64. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>By default, <computeroutput>vatomic_await_</computeroutput> functions use polite await strategies with <computeroutput>PAUSE</computeroutput> or <computeroutput>WFE</computeroutput> instructions in x86_64 and arm64, respectively. Define VATOMIC_DISABLE_POLITE_AWAIT to busy loop without such instructions. </para>
        </detaileddescription>
        <inbodydescription>
